WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.890
Module 6.

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:03.470
Protocol Research.

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:05.395
Part of Stage 3, Analyst.

00:00:06.695 --> 00:00:08.647
By the end of this module, you'll

00:00:08.647 --> 00:00:11.002
be able to complete a full due-diligence

00:00:11.002 --> 00:00:12.680
file on a real protocol.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:14.035
That's the standard.

00:00:14.035 --> 00:00:16.005
Every lesson moves you toward it.

00:00:17.305 --> 00:00:20.990
There are 7 lessons, starting with Protocol due diligence.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:22.969
Each one ends with a checklist to

00:00:22.969 --> 00:00:25.240
do for real, and a three-question quiz.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:28.150
If the topic is new to

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:30.970
you, start with Mastery Starter 6.0.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:32.865
It takes about ten minutes.

00:00:32.865 --> 00:00:35.019
Then take the lessons in order, because

00:00:35.019 --> 00:00:37.150
each one builds on the one before.

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:38.957
And do the checklists for real,

00:00:38.957 --> 00:00:40.990
with small test amounts, every time.

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:44.775
Let's begin, with lesson 6.0.
